{"id": "F2-mro-index", "failure_class": "F2", "source_lib": "OSIRIS Lab / NYU Tandon, 'Escaping Python Sandboxes'", "provenance": "the classic pyjail climb", "expression": "x.__class__.__mro__[1]", "stage": "validate", "context": "data", "expect_message": "underscore", "note": "The climb with the trailing call removed, so the underscore rule is what rejects it. Two independent barriers, each tested alone."}
